{"name":"Scholarship","hex":"#586a7d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"scholarship","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A grant-in-aid to a student.","The character or qualities of a scholar."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To attend an institution on a scholarship.","To grant a scholarship to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/scholarship"}],"entries":[{"title":"Scholarship","blocks":[{"text":"A scholarship is a form of financial aid awarded to students for further education. Generally, scholarships are awarded based on a set of criteria such as academic merit, diversity and inclusion, athletic skill, and financial need, research experience or specific professional experience."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/2015_SRNS_Family_Scholarships_%2835559759033%29.jpg/330px-2015_SRNS_Family_Scholarships_%2835559759033%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scholarship"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg/500px-Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg/1280px-Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg/500px-Scholarship_certificates_%2818491630380%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"US Aid scholarship certificates","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AScholarship_certificates_(18491630380).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Admiral_hands_out_scholarship_money_DVIDS319